#subtitle: Working hours, safety regulations, and unemployment insurance.

= Labor Rights

With control of the Labor Ministry, we can set national standards for labor. Our supporters expect us to enforce a 40-hour work week and enforce safety regulations, as well as fully fund the unemployment insurance program.

# enforce a 40-hour work week
# develop and enforce safety regulations in mines and industries
# works councils are part of another card...

@labor_rights_menu

- @minimum_wage: Establish a minimum wage.
- @increase_minimum_wage: Increase the minimum wage.
- @safety: Develop and enforce safety regulations.
- @root: Do not enact any policies.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@minimum_wage
view-if: minimum_wage <= 1
on-arrival: minimum_wage += 1; trade_unionist_dissent -= 8; new_left_dissent -= 5; trade_unionist_strength += 5; workers_spd += 2*(1-dissent); fdp_relation -= 5; cdu_relation -= 5; coalition_dissent += 1; capital_strike_progress += 1; inflation += 0.1; economic_growth -= 0.1

We have implemented a national minimum wage. This ensures that all working people can live with their wage.

@increase_minimum_wage
view-if: minimum_wage > 1
on-arrival: minimum_wage += 1; trade_unionist_dissent -= 8; new_left_dissent -= 5; trade_unionist_strength += 5; workers_spd += 2*(1-dissent); fdp_relation -= 5; cdu_relation -= 5; coalition_dissent += 1; capital_strike_progress += 1; inflation += 0.2; economic_growth -= 0.2;

We have increased the minimum wage.

@safety
on-arrival: workers_safety += 1; trade_unionist_dissent -= 5; trade_unionist_strength += 2; workers_spd += 1*(1-dissent); capital_strike_progress += 1 if workers_safety >= 3

The Labor Ministry works on developing and enforcing safety regulations, in order to ensure healty working conditions for the proletariat. [? if workers_safety >= 3 : Businesses have begun to argue that our focus on safety is overbearing and unnecessary, interfering with the economy. ?]
